{"id":"peshkom","lemma":"пешком","pos":"adv","rank":1627,"glosses":["on foot, afoot"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b8/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я пришел пешком.","en":"I came on foot.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]},{"text":"Я могу туда пешком пойти.","en":"I can go there on foot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Отсюда мы пойдём пешком.","en":"From this point, we'll go on foot.","words":[{"g":"from here, hence"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},null]},{"text":"Пешком слишком далеко?","en":"Is it too far to walk?","words":[null,{"g":"too , too much"},{"g":"far off"}]},{"text":"Сколько отсюда до твоего дома пешком?","en":"How long does it take from here to your house on foot?","words":[{"g":"how much, how many"},{"g":"from here, hence"},{"g":"until / before"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"at home"},null]}]}